$ Milestone 6, §3.6: `bring`. Brings `geometry` directly AND `shapes`
$ (which itself brings `geometry`) -- a diamond dependency that
$ driver.cpp's ModuleMerger must resolve without redeclaring `geometry`'s
$ jobs twice or erroring on a false "duplicate job" collision.

bring geometry
bring shapes

show(area(4, 5))
show(perimeter(4, 5))
show(describeRectangle(3, 7))
